  "body": "The way the spec is currently written, a \"classic\" worker is fetched using whatever document/worker created the worker as referrer for the request of the worker script. I would expect the same referrer to be used for the request of the \"main\" module of a module type worker, but the way the [run a worker](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#run-a-worker) algorithm is currently written a module type worker completely ignores the referrer parameter that is passed to the algorithm.\n",
